{title: In The Silence}
{artist: Paul Iannuzzelli}
{key: G}

{comment: Verse 1}
[D]In the silence of Your [C]majesty, [D]In the splendor of Your [C]holiness
[D]In the stillness of Your [C]glory,
[Em]Let me [D]hear Your [C]voice  [D]
[Em]The gentle [D]whisper of Your [C]voice, [D]Father

{comment: Chorus}
[G]I long to [Am7]stand before You[Em], And lay my [C]life [D]before You
[G]I come to [D]worship You [C]alone O my [D]God, [G]I reach my [Am7]hands toward you
[Em]With all my [C]heart [D]adore You, [G]Let me [D]hear Your [C]voice, [D]
[Em]Let me [D]hear Your [C]voice,[D]  [Em]Let me [D]hear Your [C]voice  [D]

{comment: Verse 2}
[D]With the power of Your [C]presence,[D] And Your beauty all [C]around me
[D]As the heavens stand in [C]awe of You,
[Em]Let me [D]hear Your [C]voice  [D]
[Em]The [D]gentle [C]whisper of [D]Your voice, Father
